 then they  will just eat the female titan's body  such an ability is useful for escaping  situations where the female's body is  trapped  or it can be used to assemble an army of  pure titans which she can then lead into  battle  the first time she did this was during  the day they broke the walls down  as it was annie that gathered the titans  outside wilmaria in the first place  the second time was when she led a horde  of titans to attack the survey corps  however a large portion of that  encounter happened mostly off-screen  extra talents of the female titan  include its endurance which is probably  the best of the nine shifters besides  the car titan  her sprinting speed is also phenomenal  not to mention her precise regeneration  hardening and agility which we saw on  full display during season  1. with that said let's get into the  backstory of annie  followed by a look at the ancient female  titans from history don't forget to hit  that sub button if you haven't already  because next week i will be doing a  video on every colossal titan as well  okay so annie's place of birth is not  confirmed but based on context we can  assume that it was somewhere on the  marlin continent  we know for a fact that she was not born  inside the internment zone as her mother  was just a regular person who lived  outside the walls of liberio  annie was the result of an affair  between her mother and an elden man  so once a butt has confirmed she was an  aldian she was sent to liberia where she  was adopted by mr leonhardt  mr leonhart had a similar story to annie  in that he was from another country but  was sent to the internal zone in mali  once his elden blood was revealed  his goal in adopting her was to turn her  into a warrior which would grant him the  status of honorary marlian and as we  know that brings a lot of benefits  including better medical care  for eldians living in mali it doesn't  get much better than that so from a  young age he would aggressively teach  